<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 6 June <span class="n">5</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/patrick-henry"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/patrick-henry.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Patrick Henry</span><span class="tp">1736–1799</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/camillo-benso-count-of-cavour"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/camillo-benso-count-of-cavour.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Camillo Benso, Count of Cavour</span><span class="tp">1810–1861</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-a-macdonald"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-a-macdonald.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John A. Macdonald</span><span class="tp">1815–1891</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/yuan-shikai"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/yuan-shikai.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Yuan Shikai</span><span class="tp">1859–1916</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/carl-gustav-jung"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/carl-gustav-jung.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Carl Gustav Jung</span><span class="tp">1875–1961</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
